  "description": "StratTraderPro System Health (M00.7.5b). Infrastructure-level view of the backend service: HTTP layer (rate / latency / error class), per-route application activity (top routes by traffic and latency, 4xx by view), and Django DB metrics (ORM-side query duration + connection rate, requires the django_prometheus engine wrapper). Includes deliberate placeholder rows for subsystems that aren't scraped yet (Postgres/Redis/Celery exporters) and for M04 webhook-ingest + broker metrics that will populate once M04 lands. Container CPU/memory deliberately omitted \u2014 multi-process gunicorn disables the prometheus_client process_* collector, and Railway container metrics aren't scraped (M10 \u00a76.5 work). Source: project-plan/plan-progress-tracker.md \u00a700.7.5b. Sibling dashboard: Auth Health (/d/stp-auth-health).",
